H("880.d.4.N",4,"Trim clips should be replaced when broken because they:","hold the trim securely and prevent rattles",["add weight","add color","cool the engine"],"Clips secure trim.")
H("880.d.4.O",3,"A student describes how seam sealer, weld-through primer and cavity wax protect a repaired panel from rust. She is discussing:","corrosion protection, including sealers, adhesives and under-coatings",["tire care","paint choices","glass care"],"Corrosion protection.")
H("880.d.4.O",4,"After welding inside a closed section, a technician applies cavity wax to:","protect the inner surface from rust",["add weight","speed drying","reduce noise"],"Rust protection.")
